ng out.","short_summary":"A daily public look at glassmaking by the museum’s glass artists.","evidence_claim":"The Toledo Museum of Art offers free fine-art glassblowing demonstrations every day at 2 p.m. in the Glass Pavilion.","source_url":"https://toledomuseum.org/amenities/glassblowing-demonstrations","source_title":"Glassblowing Demonstrations | Toledo Museum of Art","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Scheduled daily at 2 p.m.; annual maintenance, special events, or closures can affect the schedule.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"middlegrounds-metropark","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Middlegrounds Metropark","title":"Take a riverside walk at Middlegrounds","subtitle":"111 Ottawa Street • Toledo","notes":"Finish the daytime outing with the walk/bike path and Maumee River views. Stay on marked paths, dress for conditions, and leave before dark.","short_summary":"A downtown riverfront park with a documented walk/bike path.","evidence_claim":"Middlegrounds Metropark has a 1.5-mile walk/bike path and a half-mile of Maumee River frontage.","source_url":"https://metroparkstoledo.com/explore-your-parks/middlegrounds-metropark/","source_title":"Middlegrounds Metropark | Metroparks Toledo","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open daily from 7 a.m. until dark. Metroparks Toledo states that park admission is free, though programs and attractions may charge fees.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"middlegrounds-technology-explorer","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Middlegrounds Metropark Technology Explorer","title":"Turn the river walk into a scavenger hunt","subtitle":"Middlegrounds Metropark • 111 Ottawa Street","notes":"Load the listed GPS points or make it a no-device scavenger hunt. Keep to the trail and leave plants and other natural items where you find them.","short_summary":"A self-guided, geocaching-style activity along the Middlegrounds path.","evidence_claim":"Metroparks Toledo describes the Technology Explorer as a geocaching-style adventure whose information cards are visible from the trail.","source_url":"https://metroparkstoledo.com/learn-and-play/socially-responsible-activities/metroparks-technology-explorer-middlegrounds-metropark/","source_title":"Metroparks Technology Explorer: Middlegrounds Metropark | Metroparks Toledo","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The course begins at the Roundhouse Shelter and is described as about one mile round trip; stay on trail and do not collect or damage nature items.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
